Main changes made in this repository
------------------------------------
* Cut the plugin down to a headless execution service: the AI panel, chat
  client, menu entries, dock and settings dialog are gone (qgis-plugin/ went
  from 11043 to ~2400 Python lines).
* Removed remote access entirely: loopback-only HTTP, per-session token, no
  host/port setting, no shared API key, no third-party plugin bridge.
* Added a GUI-thread watchdog, a worker-thread heartbeat that distinguishes
  "busy" from "dead", an instance write lease and a read-back audit log.
* Rewrote the DSH side (dsh-tools/) as a separate bundle: ten consolidated
  tools, batch actions, permission scopes (read / write / danger), call-time
  guards, opt-in inline previews and a regression suite.

